Based on ReactOS FreeLoader:
-----------------------------
ReactOS Team
  - Original FreeLoader UEFI components
  - Filesystem drivers (FAT, NTFS, ext, Btrfs)
  - PE/COFF loader implementation
  - NT/Windows boot support

